<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh August trade deficit at $235.64 mln.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh August trade deficit at $235.64 mln.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's trade deficit widened to $235.64 million in August from $159.36 million in July and $203.5 in August, 1995, central bank officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>BANGLADESH'S BALANCE OF TRADE</p>
<p>(In million U.S. dollar)</p>
<p>			  AUGUST    JULY     AUGUST 95</p>
<p>    Exports	   411.36    355.64   314.75</p>
<p>    Imports	   647.0     515.0    518.25</p>
<p>    Balance	  -235.64   -159.36  -203.50</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
</text>
